2026-10-16T01:23:05.3633658Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3643956Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3749019Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3759604Z [0m
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3760349Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3761397Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3761920Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3762720Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3763753Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3764392Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3764787Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3765611Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3766039Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3766544Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3767286Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3768203Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3769584Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3769893Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3770454Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3770807Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3771072Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3771589Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3771784Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3771932Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3772154Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3772656Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3773271Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3775546Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3775782Z I will:
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3776242Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3776662Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3777582Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3778729Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3779453Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3780105Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3780744Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3781627Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3782364Z    /root
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3792176Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3793234Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3803604Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3804610Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3806800Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3807226Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3807666Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3823146Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3833754Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3834594Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3835316Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3836153Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3836570Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3836835Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3837200Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3837505Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3838380Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3838652Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3838792Z If you would like to
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3839105Z see the output, try like this:
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3839316Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3839516Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3839966Z   $ sh ./install-nix
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3840139Z 
2026-10-16T01:23:05.3840172Z 
